model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.1.8 R16 (#200), item #183 (P62): a projection counts a leg by the leg's own day. early is dated 2026-01-15 and its leg 2026-03-01: bal from 2026-02-01 counts it (a: 100.00 PLN three times; both print 0.00 before 2.1.8); no-item 4, low from t where a leg with its own on falls in the window and its movement is dated before t (b)"

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input d_mv: date
input d_leg: date

move early: transfers
  on d_mv
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt on d_leg

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "c"
  d_mv = 2026-01-15 "c"
  d_leg = 2026-03-01 "c"
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"

ask a: bal(konto, 2026-04-30) from 2026-02-01 with uncertain, bal(konto, 2026-04-30) from 2026-02-01, bal(konto, 2026-04-30)
ask b: low(konto, 2026-02-01 .. 2026-04-30) from 2026-02-01, low(konto, 2026-03-01 .. 2026-04-30) from 2026-02-01
